# nanoMODBUS module Kconfig
config NANOMODBUS
	bool "nanoMODBUS Modbus RTU/TCP library"
	default y
	help
	  nanoMODBUS (https://github.com/debevv/nanoMODBUS, MIT) exposed as a Zephyr
	  module so it can be reused across projects. Provides the Modbus protocol
	  implementation that the application's master wrapper builds on; the library
	  itself is transport-agnostic, so the caller supplies the read/write
	  functions that touch the UART or socket.
